{
"recipe_id":"13 Quick Greek-Yogurt Moussaka",
"source_text":"1. 烤箱上下火预热至 200°C。\n2. 深煎锅大火加热，将牛肉末炒约 5 分钟至上色。\n3. 用叉子在茄子上扎孔，放入微波炉高火加热 3–5 分钟至变软。\n4. 将希腊酸奶、蛋液和帕玛森奶酪混合搅拌均匀，并稍微调味，制成酸奶酱。\n5. 将番茄、番茄膏和土豆加入牛肉中，调味并加热至滚热。\n6. 将锅中肉酱表面抹平。把变软的茄子切片，铺在肉酱上，再倒上酸奶混合液并抹平。\n7. 整锅放入烤箱，烤至表层凝固并呈金黄色。出炉后建议放凉约 5 分钟再切。",
"text_steps":[{"id": "S001", "text": "烤箱上下火预热至 200°C", "text_en": "Preheat the oven with upper and lower heat to 200°C.", "start_char": 3, "end_char": 17, "node_indices": [1, 2], "edge_indices": [1], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 1, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 1, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S002", "text": "深煎锅大火加热", "text_en": "Heat a deep frying pan over high heat.", "start_char": 22, "end_char": 29, "node_indices": [3, 4], "edge_indices": [2], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 2, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 2, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S003", "text": "将牛肉末炒约 5 分钟至上色", "text_en": "Stir-fry the ground beef for about 5 minutes until browned.", "start_char": 30, "end_char": 44, "node_indices": [4, 5, 6], "edge_indices": [3, 4], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 3, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 3, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 4, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 4, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S004", "text": "用叉子在茄子上扎孔", "text_en": "Pierce the eggplant with a fork.", "start_char": 49, "end_char": 58, "node_indices": [7, 8], "edge_indices": [5], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 5, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 5, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S005", "text": "放入微波炉高火加热 3–5 分钟至变软", "text_en": "Put the eggplant in the microwave and heat on high for 3–5 minutes until softened.", "start_char": 59, "end_char": 79, "node_indices": [8, 9, 10], "edge_indices": [6, 7], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 6, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 6, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 7, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 7, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S006", "text": "将希腊酸奶、蛋液和帕玛森奶酪混合搅拌均匀", "text_en": "Add the beaten egg to the Greek yogurt as part of combining the yogurt, egg, and Parmesan evenly.", "start_char": 83, "end_char": 103, "node_indices": [11, 12], "edge_indices": [8], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 8, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 8, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S007", "text": "将希腊酸奶、蛋液和帕玛森奶酪混合搅拌均匀", "text_en": "Add the Parmesan to the Greek yogurt as part of combining the yogurt, egg, and Parmesan evenly.", "start_char": 83, "end_char": 103, "node_indices": [11, 13], "edge_indices": [9], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 9, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 9, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S008", "text": "将希腊酸奶、蛋液和帕玛森奶酪混合搅拌均匀", "text_en": "Stir the Greek yogurt, beaten egg, and Parmesan together until evenly mixed.", "start_char": 83, "end_char": 103, "node_indices": [11, 14], "edge_indices": [10], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 10, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 10, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S009", "text": "并稍微调味，制成酸奶酱", "text_en": "Season lightly to make the yogurt sauce.", "start_char": 104, "end_char": 115, "node_indices": [14, 15], "edge_indices": [11], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 11, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 11, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S010", "text": "将番茄、番茄膏和土豆加入牛肉中", "text_en": "Add the tomatoes to the beef, along with the tomato paste and potatoes.", "start_char": 120, "end_char": 135, "node_indices": [6, 16], "edge_indices": [12], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 12, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 12, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S011", "text": "将番茄、番茄膏和土豆加入牛肉中", "text_en": "Add the tomato paste to the beef, along with the tomatoes and potatoes.", "start_char": 120, "end_char": 135, "node_indices": [6, 17], "edge_indices": [13], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 13, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 13, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S012", "text": "将番茄、番茄膏和土豆加入牛肉中", "text_en": "Add the potatoes to the beef, along with the tomatoes and tomato paste.", "start_char": 120, "end_char": 135, "node_indices": [6, 18], "edge_indices": [14], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 14, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 14, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S013", "text": "调味", "text_en": "Season the beef mixture.", "start_char": 136, "end_char": 138, "node_indices": [6, 19], "edge_indices": [15], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 15, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 15, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S014", "text": "加热至滚热", "text_en": "Heat the beef mixture until piping hot.", "start_char": 139, "end_char": 144, "node_indices": [19, 20], "edge_indices": [16], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 16, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 20, "edge_index": 16, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S015", "text": "将锅中肉酱表面抹平", "text_en": "Level the surface of the meat sauce in the pan.", "start_char": 149, "end_char": 159, "node_indices": [20, 21], "edge_indices": [17], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 20, "edge_index": 17, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 17, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S016", "text": "把变软的茄子切片", "text_en": "Slice the softened eggplant.", "start_char": 160, "end_char": 167, "node_indices": [10, 22], "edge_indices": [18], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 18, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 22, "edge_index": 18, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S017", "text": "把变软的茄子切片，铺在肉酱上", "text_en": "Layer the sliced, softened eggplant over the meat sauce.", "start_char": 160, "end_char": 173, "node_indices": [21, 22], "edge_indices": [19], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 22, "edge_index": 19, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 19, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S018", "text": "再倒上酸奶混合液", "text_en": "Then pour the yogurt mixture over it.", "start_char": 174, "end_char": 182, "node_indices": [15, 21], "edge_indices": [20], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 20, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 20, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S019", "text": "并抹平", "text_en": "Spread it evenly.", "start_char": 182, "end_char": 186, "node_indices": [21, 23], "edge_indices": [21], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 21, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 23, "edge_index": 21, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S020", "text": "整锅放入烤箱", "text_en": "Put the whole pan in the oven.", "start_char": 190, "end_char": 196, "node_indices": [2, 23], "edge_indices": [22], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 23, "edge_index": 22, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 22, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S021", "text": "烤至表层凝固并呈金黄色", "text_en": "Bake until the topping is set and golden.", "start_char": 197, "end_char": 209, "node_indices": [2, 24], "edge_indices": [23], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 23, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 24, "edge_index": 23, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S022", "text": "建议放凉约 5 分钟", "text_en": "It is recommended to let it cool for about 5 minutes.", "start_char": 212, "end_char": 222, "node_indices": [24, 25], "edge_indices": [24], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 24, "edge_index": 24, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 25, "edge_index": 24, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S023", "text": "再切", "text_en": "Then cut it.", "start_char": 222, "end_char": 224, "node_indices": [25, 26], "edge_indices": [25], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 25, "edge_index": 25, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 26, "edge_index": 25, "role": "output"}]}],
